-- Since top-level initialisation rule I3, `medaka check`, `run` and `build` refuse this
-- program with T-CYCLIC-VALUE before any engine runs: `cell` mentions itself in a
-- deref position while it is initialised (test/rejection_parity_fixtures.txt pins that
-- on native and wasm). The prelude-free llvm probe runs no typechecker, so it still
-- emits `cell` as a lazy global that `main` reads, printing the String "under".
cell = if True then "under" else cell

main = cell
